:name: F91 Jepler Emulator (nRF52840)
:description: This script runs the Zephyr RTOS firmware for the f91_jepler on a virtual nRF52840.

using sysbus
$name?="nRF52840"
mach create $name

machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/cpus/nrf52840.repl

# Renode's nRF52840 model uses a dummy Tag for FICR.
# Zephyr's NVMC driver reads FICR to determine flash size.
# If it returns 0, MCUboot fails to read the flash image.
# We replace it with MappedMemory and set the size correctly (256 pages * 4096 bytes = 1MB).
machine LoadPlatformDescriptionFromString "ficr: Memory.MappedMemory @ sysbus 0x10000000 { size: 0x1000 }"

macro reset
"""
    sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x10000010 0x00000100
    sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x10000014 0x00001000

    sysbus LoadELF $mcuboot_bin
    sysbus LoadBinary $app_bin 0x0c000
"""

runMacro $reset
